, "text": "Friday night has become just another weeknight in terms of socialization.\n\nSource: @jameslynch32 https://t.co/dGyJ6fvKoj", "url": "https://x.com/SoberLook/status/2114383629480501392"}, {"author_id": "497231011", "created_at": "2026-10-25T15:43:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114382227291148615"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/ftchina/status…", "end": 122, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/ftchina/status/2114228465306075603", "start": 99, "url": "https://t.co/iY7ZuNYkiU"}]}, "id": "2114382227291148615", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1496, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114228465306075603", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "This trajectory was clear as day, for those companies that rely on data instead of blind optimism. https://t.co/iY7ZuNYkiU", "url": "https://x.com/ChinaBeigeBook/status/2114382227291148615"}, {"author_id": "733647469305864195", "created_at": "2026-10-25T15:06:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114373045850919297"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/FjKsGS5WsN", "end": 269, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Brad_Setser/status/2114373045850919297/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114372779747540992", "start": 246, "url": "https://t.co/FjKsGS5WsN"}, {"display_url": "x.com/Brad_Setser/st…", "end": 293, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/Brad_Setser/status/2114368861042880517", "start": 270, "url": "https://t.co/RUwXJiibJC"}]}, "id": "2114373045850919297", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 11, "impression_count": 7279, "like_count": 32, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 5}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114368861042880517", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Chinese, Korean and Taiwanese current account surplus relative to the GDP of the United States, the largest deficit country --\n\nChina is a proxy for obvious reasons to those who follow me\n\nA way to try to put the current rise in perspective\n\n1/2 https://t.co/FjKsGS5WsN https://t.co/RUwXJiibJC", "url": "https://x.com/Brad_Setser/status/2114373045850919297"}, {"author_id": "733647469305864195", "created_at": "2026-10-25T14:49:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114368861042880517"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/sQTh52d4X9", "end": 258, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Brad_Setser/status/2114368861042880517/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114368812468588544", "start": 235, "url": "https://t.co/sQTh52d4X9"}]}, "id": "2114368861042880517", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 10, "impression_count": 12001, "like_count": 31, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 7}, "text": "Something a bit different --\n\nKorea and Taiwan's current account surplus (q3 is a projection/ q4 is a forecast based in q3) as a share of US GDP .... trying to capture visually how the AI buildout is flowing to the chip exporters.\n\n1/ https://t.co/sQTh52d4X9", "url": "https://x.com/Brad_Setser/status/2114368861042880517"}, {"author_id": "497231011", "created_at": "2026-10-25T13:47:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114353170189091075"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/business/statu…", "end": 37, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/business/status/2114160077485564302", "start": 14, "url": "https://t.co/ctTdNFBHV0"}]}, "id": "2114353170189091075", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 2373, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 2}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114160077485564302", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Not stimulus! https://t.co/ctTdNFBHV0", "url": "https://x.com/ChinaBeigeBook/status/2114353170189091075"}, {"author_id": "733647469305864195", "created_at": "2026-10-25T13:05:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114342624614293506"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/JdlvRSCV7e", "end": 254, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Brad_Setser/status/2114342624614293506/photo/1", "media_key": "3_21143425800456